["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"}," skill to sustain yourself in urban or civilized environments. See the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Basic Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Basic_Survival"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"}," skill for more information.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
